 "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.026}, {"kind": "final", "t": 2.6, "piece": "programs work?", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.026}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 3.2, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Antivirus programs work by detecting, preventing, and removing malware (malicious software) from your computer . They do this through a combination of technique", "compute_s": 1.046}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 3.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "file.\n\n2. **Heuristic Analysis**: In addition to signature-based detection, many antivirus programs use heuristic analysis to identify malware that may not yet ", "compute_s": 1.419}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 4.4, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "to potentially malicious websites and downloads.\n\n4. **Behavior -Based Detection**: This technique involves monitoring the actions of programs and files on your", "compute_s": 1.143}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 5.0, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "regularly update their databases of signatures, heuristics, and other detection methods to stay current with new threats . This ensures that they can effectivel", "compute_s": 1.171}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 5.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "enabling security features like two-factor authentication.\n\n9. **Cloud-Based Scanning**: Some antivirus programs use cloud-based scanning to quickly analyze fil", "compute_s": 1.186}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 6.2, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "to keep your computer safe and secure.", "compute_s": 0.145}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 6.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_thinking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.029},