7 Support:** Most cloud storage providers offer 24/7 customer support , ensuring that users can get help whenever they need it.\n\n### 11. **Privacy and Co", "compute_s": 0.524}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 19.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "- **Fine-grained Access Control:** Cloud storage platforms allow users to control who has access to their data, setting permissions at various levels (e.g ., re", "compute_s": 1.236}], "render": {"placed_speech_s": 21.549, "placed_within_input_s": 17.549, "speech_beyond_input_s": 0, "clipped_speech_s": 2.256, "tail_s": 4.0, "turns": 2}}